# Vampire Soulcaller: "When this creature enters, return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand." (CR 603.6a, 400.3) Bot2 bolts Bot1's Memnite and Ornithopter on turn 2 and Entombs a
# Memnite of its own. On turn 3 Bot1 pays {4}{B} (the Lotus, sacrificed first, so it joins the graveyard, plus Mox Jet and Mox Pearl): the Black Lotus (not a creature card) and Bot2's Memnite
# (not in Bot1's graveyard) are refused as targets, and the Ornithopter goes to Bot1's hand (not the battlefield).

